From 3a3df57aa0c6e8777dc88ce0f277d61eaeef1d16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 10:32:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper UI flip: theme baked into all pages, dashboard is
 landing page

- inject /reaper/reaper_content.css + top-level shell bounce into every
  TopBanner page (138 base + 11 sysdep overlay candidates) - no more
  stock-color flash, every page opened outside the shell jumps into
  reaper_shell.asp#<page>; index.asp opened top-level goes to the
  dashboard, making Main_ReaperDash.asp the post-login landing page
- reaper_shell: PILOTS map removed, DEFAULT_PAGE=index.asp, hashchange
  navigation, runtime css injector kept as fallback
- Main_ReaperDash: 21 rail items wired to reaper_shell.asp#<page>
- R_ pilot pages deleted (pilot phase over)
- displayed firmware version now capitalizes Reaper (extendno display
  patched in state.js + 4 pages; EXTENDNO stays lowercase so image
  filenames are unchanged)
